OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPlenty of
OL,6,Fcloud through the evening with
OL,7,Foutbreaks of rain, perhaps heavy at
OL,8,Ftimes. This slowly clearing to the
OL,9,Fsouth after midnight, leaving clear
OL,10,Fspells behind and frost to develop in
OL,11,Fplaces.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FAny lingering rain soon
OL,14,Fclearing to the southeast. Then
OL,15,Fgenerally fine and dry, though
OL,16,Fisolated showers may develop in the
OL,17,Fafternoon. Brisk coastal winds
OL,18,Fdeveloping. Temperatures near normal.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
